  "question": {
    "text": "If the coefficients of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math>, in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, are <math> <mi>m</mi> </math> and <math> <mi>n</mi> </math> respectively, then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
